title: "Boundary-Complete Relational Dynamics (BCRD)"
authors:
  - family-names: "Croydon-McRae"
    given-names: "Tobias"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Tobillicious/bcrd"
url: "https://github.com/Tobillicious/bcrd"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.6084/m9.figshare.33716677"
    description: "Current public archival BCRD release on Figshare"
keywords:
  - quantum dynamics
  - coarse-graining
  - quantum channels
  - relational dynamics
  - quantum information
  - Racah recoupling
  - BCRD
abstract: >
  Boundary-Complete Relational Dynamics (BCRD) is a finite quantum-dynamics
  research programme studying when relationally accessible records inside
  closed quantum systems can support effective dynamics of their own. This
  public repository contains publication manuscripts, reviewed results,
  reproducibility artifacts, and frozen provenance.
